### Role of this file

**What this file is for:** **How much** — the numeric ladder (`$gap-*`, `$padding-*`, `$radius-*`, type scale tables, `SectionHeader` sizing). **What this file is *not*:** composition rules (insets, sheets, card/list ownership) — those live in **`.cursor/design.mdc`**.

**If something disagrees with the pipeline:** **`paytm-common-storybook/configs/design-tokens.json`** and the **generated** Sass/CSS under `commonStyles/sass-generated/` and `style-dictionary/` are authoritative. Update tokens and regenerate; do not “fix” spacing only inside this doc and leave JSON stale.

## Token source files (quick map)

| File | Contents |
|------|----------|
| `design-tokens.json` | `color-primitives`, `color-semantics`, `typography`, `number-primitives`, `number-semantics` |
| `_number.scss` | `$unit-*`, `$gap-*`, `$padding-*`, `$margin-*`, `$radius-*` |
| `_typography.scss` | Scale sizes/line-heights, `$typography-weight-*` |
| `_colors.scss` | Semantic colour map consumed by build (do not edit by hand — generated) |
| `variables.css` | `:root` and `@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)` semantic **`--*`** variables |

**In components:** SCSS modules import `mixin` / `commonStyles` and use **`$unit-*`**, **`$gap-*`**, **`$padding-*`**, **`$margin-*`**, **`$radius-*`**, plus **`getFontStyle(...)`** and **`getColorVariable(--token-name)`**.

